cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "py-phone-caller & OpenAlert: Sovereign Emergency Telephony, Offline Neural TTS & Decentralized Mesh Alerting Suite"
message: "If you use py-phone-caller, OpenAlert (openalertd), or the NIP-ALERT specification in research, civil-defense, or open-source systems, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
