abstract: >-
  py-phone-caller and OpenAlert (openalertd) form an open-source, self-hosted
  emergency notification and off-grid mesh routing platform combining Python 3.14
  telephony microservices, Asterisk 22 ARI voice synthesis and DTMF acknowledgment,
  always-UCS-2 cellular GSM SMS, and a pure-Rust decentralized alert router across
  Nostr (NIP-ALERT Kind 30000 & NIP-17 C2), BitChat BLE (Noise XX), sub-GHz LoRa RF,
  and offline Emergency /sos Wi-Fi Captive Portals.
